<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 0.86 to 7331.04.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 2.92 to 441.78, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.29.</p>
<p>Advancers outpaced decliners 1583 to 908.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 532,424,840 compared with 464,040,000 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
